      "examples": [
        {
          "label": "process_logistics",
          "chunk_id": "6428dfc751dd697b",
          "terms": [
            "AI"
          ],
          "text": "✅ Do use AI to prep, polish, or research—it’s a smart way to show up feeling confident. ❌ Don’t use AI to misrepresent your work, fabricate answers, or submit anything that isn’t truly yours. ✨ We want to meet the real you. Not the AI-generated version. Why? Because we’re not just hiring for skills—"
        },
        {
          "label": "process_logistics",
          "chunk_id": "0cd67ff3355d808e",
          "terms": [
            "AI"
          ],
          "text": "We love and use AI every day at HubSpot, but we deploy it where it makes sense. We use AI to remove friction from the process so our recruiters can focus on what really matters: meaningful conversations with candidates. Our goal is to enhance the human experience, not automate it. Because the AI lan"
        },
        {
          "label": "process_logistics",
          "chunk_id": "97c300f51b9ffced",
          "terms": [
            "AI"
          ],
          "text": "✅ AI supports our process, but people make the decisions. We will never use AI to make a hiring decision. ✅ We use AI to help, not to hide. When AI is used to support scheduling or screen resumes, it’s always reviewed by a recruiter—and we regularly check for fairness, bias, and accuracy."
        }
      ]
